<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>{{title}}</title>
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root {
    --ink: #0e0e0e; --ink-muted: #555; --ink-faint: #8a8a8a;
    --rule: #e0ddd8; --bg: #faf9f6; --bg-card: #fff;
    --green: #1a5c3a; --green-bg: #eaf5ee;
    --amber: #7a4a00; --amber-bg: #fdf3de;
    --red: #7a1a1a; --red-bg: #fdeaea;
    --blue: #0f3f75; --blue-bg: #e6f0fb;
    --serif: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    --mono: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 2rem 6rem; }
  .doc-header { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 2rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .doc-meta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .kind-badge { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.2em 0.7em; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--blue-bg); color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin-bottom: 0.8rem; }
  .tagline { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--ink-muted); max-width: 640px; line-height: 1.6; }
  section { margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  section:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }
  .section-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  h3 { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-muted); margin: 1.6rem 0 0.5rem; }
  p { margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
  p.note { border-left: 3px solid var(--rule); padding-left: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  ul, ol { margin: 0.6rem 0 1rem 1.4rem; }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.35rem; }
  code { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85em; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 0.1em 0.4em; border-radius: 3px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; font-size: 0.93rem; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  th { background: var(--bg-card); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.78rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-muted); }
  a { color: var(--blue); }
  .gap-marker { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.15em 0.55em; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--amber-bg); color: var(--amber); }
  .label { display: inline-block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.05em 0.5em; border-radius: 4px; }
  .label-inferred { background: var(--amber-bg); color: var(--amber); }
  .label-unverified, .label-refused { background: var(--red-bg); color: var(--red); }
  .label-note { background: var(--blue-bg); color: var(--blue); }
  .cite-file { color: var(--green); }
  .cite-said { font-style: italic; color: var(--blue); }
  .cite-bad { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.85em; color: var(--red); }
  .doc-footer { margin-top: 4rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-faint); }
  strong { font-weight: 600; }
  em { font-style: italic; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="doc-header">
  <div class="kind-badge">Competitor brief &middot; report only</div>
  <h1>{{title}}</h1>
  <p class="doc-meta">{{meta}}</p>
  <p class="tagline">This brief describes a competitor from the public pages fetched in one research run. It does not copy or reproduce the competitor's product, code, text or design. Rows labelled "inferred, no source" and GAP markers show where the evidence runs out.</p>
</header>

{{sections}}

<footer class="doc-footer">
  Rendered from draft.json &middot; brief date {{brief_date}} (generated_at {{generated_at}}) &middot; GAP markers {{gap_count}}
</footer>

</body>
</html>
